                  "body": "I re-edited this video to showcase some of my recording, editing and sound design abilities. ALL AUDIO SOURCE MATERIAL in this video, with the exception of music, was recorded and or performed by myself. I also edited the music of Steve Jablonsky to compliment the flow of the video.\n\n<video-embed platform=\"vimeo\" id=\"5212864\" title=\"Transformers Re-Edit video\"></video-embed>\n\n[Transformers Demo 3.0 (Orchestral)](https://vimeo.com/5212864) from [Adam Smith-Kipnis](https://vimeo.com/user1378322) on [Vimeo](https://vimeo.com/)."
